Provided that, where the Insurer could not participate in the tender for reasons referred at Clause (11) above, the insurer shall not participate in any Government sponsored tender process unless an explicit approval for such participation is sought by the insurer and approved by the Authority. 

12. Any information pertaining to Government Sponsored Scheme shall be submitted to the Authority as and when required.
